#: CommentShape.cpp:57
msgid "The plugin needed for displaying comments is not present."
msgstr "Vos n' avoz nén l' tchôke-divins po håyner les rawetes di tecse."

#: CommentShape.cpp:57
msgid "Plugin Missing"
msgstr "I manke on tchôke-divins"

#: CommentShape.cpp:60
msgid ""
"The plugin needed for displaying the comment is not compatible with the "
"current version of the comment shape."
msgstr ""
"Li tchôke-divins k' i fåt po håyner les rawetes di tecse n' est nén "
"compatibe avou l' modêye do moumint del fôme di rawete di tecse."

#: CommentShape.cpp:61
msgid "Plugin Incompatible"
msgstr "Tchôke-divins nén compatibe."

#: CommentShapeFactory.cpp:30
msgid "Comment"
msgstr "Rawete di tecse"

#: CommentToolFactory.cpp:30
msgid "Comment Tool"
msgstr "Usteye di rawete di tecse"
